    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli walianza safari tena, wakaenda kupiga kambi yao katika tambarare za Moabu, mashariki ya mto Yordani, kuelekea mji wa Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Balaki mwana wa Sipori, alijua mambo yote Waisraeli waliyowatendea Waamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye pamoja na Wamoabu wakashikwa na hofu kubwa juu ya Waisraeli. Waliwaogopa hasa kwa sababu ya wingi wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Wamoabu wakawaambia viongozi wa Midiani, “Umati huu punde si punde utaharibu kila kitu kandokando yetu kama fahali alavyo majani shambani.” Kwa hiyo, Balaki mwana wa Sipori, aliyekuwa mfalme wa Moabu wakati huo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 31:8; 2Pet 2:15-16; Yuda 11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akapeleka ujumbe kwa Balaamu, mwana wa Beori, huko Pethori, karibu na mto Eufrate, nchini Amawi. Alimwambia Balaamu hivi: “Kuna taifa ambalo limetoka Misri, nalo limeenea kila mahali nchini, tena linatishia kuchukua ardhi yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoo sasa uwalaani watu hawa kwa ajili yangu maana wana nguvu kuliko mimi. Labda nitaweza kuwashinda na kuwafukuza wasiingie katika nchi yangu, kwa maana najua kuwa wewe ukimbariki mtu hubarikiwa, ukimlaani mtu hulaaniwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, maofisa wa Moabu na Midiani wakachukua ada ya mwaguzi, wakaondoka kwenda kwa Balaamu. Walipowasili, walimpa Balaamu ujumbe wa Balaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu akawaambia, “Laleni huku usiku huu, nami nitawajulisheni atakayoniambia Mwenyezi-Mungu.” Basi, wazee hao wa Moabu wakakaa na Balaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mungu alimjia Balaamu, akamwuliza, “Ni nani hawa wanaokaa nawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu akamjibu Mungu, “Balaki mwana wa Sipori amenipelekea ujumbe kwamba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuna watu wa taifa fulani waliotoka Misri, nao wameenea kila mahali nchini. Ameniomba niende kuwalaani watu hao ili pengine afaulu kupigana nao na kuwafukuza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu akamwambia Balaamu, “Usiende pamoja na watu hawa, wala usiwalaani watu hao maana wamebarikiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, asubuhi yake Balaamu aliamka, akawaambia maofisa wa Balaki, “Rudini nchini mwenu, kwa maana Mwenyezi-Mungu hapendi kuniruhusu kwenda pamoja nanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo maofisa wa Moabu wakaondoka, wakarudi kwa Balaki, wakamwambia, “Balaamu amekataa kuja pamoja nasi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Balaki akatuma maofisa wengine, wengi zaidi na wa vyeo vya juu kuliko wale wa kwanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao walifika kwa Balaamu, wakamwambia, “Balaki mwana wa Sipori asema hivi: ‘Usikubali kuzuiwa na chochote hata uache kuja kwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitakutunukia heshima kubwa, na chochote utakachoniomba nitakutimizia. Njoo uwalaani watu hawa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Balaamu akawajibu watumishi wa Balaki, “Hata kama Balaki atanipa nyumba yake imejaa fedha na dhahabu, mimi sitaweza kuvunja amri ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wangu, kuhusu jambo lolote, dogo au kubwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini tafadhalini laleni hapa usiku huu kama wale wenzenu, nami nipate kujua atakachoniambia Mwenyezi-Mungu tena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mungu akamjia Balaamu usiku huo, akamwambia, “Kama watu hawa wamekuja kukuita, nenda pamoja nao, lakini fanya tu kile nitakachokuambia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu akaamka asubuhi, akatandika punda wake, akaenda pamoja na hao maofisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasira ya Mungu iliwaka kwa sababu Balaamu alikuwa anakwenda; hivyo malaika wa Mwenyezi-Mungu akakabiliana naye njiani. Wakati huo Balaamu alikuwa amepanda punda wake akiwa na watumishi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, punda alimwona malaika huyo wa Mwenyezi-Mungu amesimama njiani, ameshika upanga uliochomolewa alani mwake. Kwa hiyo aliiacha njia, akaenda pembeni. Balaamu akampiga huyo punda, akamrudisha njiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha malaika huyo wa Mwenyezi-Mungu akatangulia mbele, akasimama mahali penye njia nyembamba, kati ya mashamba ya mizabibu na kuta pande zote mbili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Punda alipomwona malaika huyo wa Mwenyezi-Mungu, akajisukumiza ukutani na kuubana mguu wa Balaamu hapo. Kwa hiyo Balaamu akampiga tena huyo punda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha malaika akatangulia tena, akasimama mahali pembamba pasipo na nafasi ya kupita kulia wala kushoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Punda alipomwona huyo malaika wa Mwenyezi-Mungu, akalala chini. Balaamu akawaka hasira, akampiga kwa fimbo yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Mwenyezi-Mungu akakifunua kinywa cha huyo punda, akamwambia Balaamu, “Nimekutendea nini hata ukanipiga mara hizi tatu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu akamwambia punda, “Wewe umenidhihaki! Kama ningekuwa na upanga ningalikuulia mbali sasa hivi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Punda akamwambia Balaamu, “Je, mimi si yuleyule punda wako aliyekubeba maisha yako yote hadi siku hii ya leo? Je, nimewahi kukutendea namna hii?” Balaamu akajibu, “La.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo, Mwenyezi-Mungu akayafungua macho ya Balaamu, naye akamwona malaika wa Mwenyezi-Mungu amesimama njiani, ameshika upanga uliochomolewa alani mwake. Balaamu akajitupa chini kifudifudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Balaamu, “Mbona umempiga punda wako mara hizi tatu? Nimekuja kukuzuia, kwa sababu njia yako ni mbaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "njia yako ni mbaya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania si dhahiri.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Punda wako ameniona akaniepa mara hizi tatu. Kama asingaligeuka mbali nami hakika ningalikuua wewe na kumwacha hai punda huyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu akamwambia malaika wa Mwenyezi-Mungu “Nimetenda dhambi maana sikujua kwamba umesimama njiani kunizuia. Sasa, kama haikupendezi niendelee na safari hii, basi nitarudi nyumbani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini malaika wa Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Balaamu, “Nenda na watu hawa, lakini utasema tu kile nitakachokuambia.” Basi, Balaamu akaendelea na safari pamoja na viongozi wa Balaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki alipopata habari kwamba Balaamu anakuja, alitoka kwenda kumlaki mjini Ari, mji uliokuwa ukingoni mwa mto Arnoni kwenye mpaka wa Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki akamwambia Balaamu, “Kwa nini hukuja kwangu mara moja nilipokuita? Je, ulifikiri sitaweza kukutunukia heshima ya kutosha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu akamjibu Balaki, “Sasa nimekuja! Lakini, je, nina mamlaka ya kusema chochote tu? Jambo atakaloniambia Mungu ndilo ninalopaswa kusema.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Balaamu akaenda pamoja na Balaki wakafika mjini Kiriath-husothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huko Balaki alitoa kafara ya ng'ombe na kondoo, akawagawia nyama Balaamu na maofisa waliokuwa pamoja naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
